</section><section class="section section--about" id="scroll-to-me">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="grid__cell grid__cell--2-3">
                <div class="category">
                    <p class="category__text"><span class="category__number">01</span>Sustainable Energy Ecosystems</p>
                </div>

                <h1 class="heading heading--l heading--dark">Solar Panels and Integrated Solutions Made in Europe</h1>
                <div class="text-block text-block--dark reveal-text-block">
                    <p>SoliTek panels are made in Europe and built to last. They are designed for the most challenging weather conditions, including heavy snow, hurricane-level winds, and severe hail.</p>

<p>We do not cut corners. Every panel is manufactured in the EU using renewable energy and is designed for reliable performance for at least 50 years.</p>

<p>We started with solar panels for residential installations, and we still make them today. Yet, since 2014, we have expanded our innovation into integrated solar solutions for a wide range of applications, including solar carports, in-roof systems, facades, noise barriers, and agrivoltaics.</p>

<p>Tough, European-made solar panels for projects where quality matters.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
        <div class="row">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="container__container">
                                    <div class="container__wrapper container__wrapper--1-3">
                        <article class="card card--about">
                            <div class="card__image">
                                <img src="/storage/app/media/homepage/SoliTek-new-module-portfolio-2026-400x349.jpg" alt="Toughest solar panels in the world">
                            </div>
                            <div class="card__content">
                                <h3 class="heading heading--dark heading--m">Toughest solar panels in the world</h3>
                                <div class="text-block text-block--dark reveal-text-block">
                                    <p><span >3.2 + 3.2 mm double heat-strengthened glass makes SoliTek modules probably the thickest solar panels in the world.</span></p>

<p>This construction gives them exceptional strength and durability:</p>

<ul type="disc">
	<li>Resistant to 50 mm hail - the highest Hail Class 5 rating</li>
	<li>Resistant to heavy snow loads up to 10,500 Pa - equal to around 10 meters of snow per 1 m²</li>
	<li>Resistant to hurricane-speed winds up to 320 km/h - 5,400 Pa</li>
</ul>

<p>Thanks to this extreme mechanical resistance, SoliTek panels come with a 30-year product warranty and are designed for a 50-year lifetime. After 30 years, we still guarantee 90% efficiency.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="container__wrapper container__wrapper--1-3">
                        <article class="card card--about">
                            <div class="card__image">
                                <img src="/storage/app/media/homepage/greenest-solar-panels-teraccota-400x347.jpg" alt="And the greenest ones also">
                            </div>
                            <div class="card__content">
                                <h3 class="heading heading--dark heading--m">And the greenest ones also</h3>
                                <div class="text-block text-block--dark reveal-text-block">
                                    <p><span >SoliTek panels are sustainably and ethically made in Europe, using green electricity in the manufacturing process.</span></p>

<p>They are designed with circularity in mind:</p>

<ul type="disc">
	<li>98.8% recyclable</li>
	<li>Made with 35% recycled glass</li>
	<li>Manufactured using 100% renewable energy</li>
</ul>

<p>Most of SoliTek solar panels are <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Cradle to Cradle Certified®</span> <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Full Scope, Silver level, Version 4.1</span>. This makes them one of the greenest solar panels available today.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                                    <div class="container__wrapper container__wrapper--1-3">
                        <article class="card card--about">
                            <div class="card__image">
                                <img src="/storage/app/media/homepage/carport-solar-panels-integrated-2.jpg" alt="Built into Every Structure">
                            </div>
                            <div class="card__content">
                                <h3 class="heading heading--dark heading--m">Built into Every Structure</h3>
                                <div class="text-block text-block--dark reveal-text-block">
                                    <p><span >SoliTek believes solar energy should be integrated into the spaces we already use - not only placed in gigawatt solar parks.</span></p>

<p>That is why we develop solar solutions for existing and future infrastructure:</p>

<ul type="disc">
	<li>Solar carports</li>
	<li>PV-integrated noise barriers</li>
	<li>Solar facades</li>
	<li>In-roof solar solutions</li>
	<li>Agrovoltaic systems</li>
</ul>

<p>By turning buildings, roadsides, roofs, and other everyday structures into clean energy sources, SoliTek helps capture more power from the sun while leaving a smaller carbon footprint.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>
