<section class="section section--solar-cells">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="container__container">
                <div class="container__wrapper--1-2">
                    <div class="container__inner">
                        <div class="category">
                            <p class="category__text"><span class="category__number">03</span>R&amp;D and Practice</p>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="heading heading--l heading--dark">Integrated Solutions – Usability of SoliTek Solar Panels</h2>
                    </div>

                    <div class="image image--hasBorder">
                        <img src="/storage/app/media/homepage/saules-elektrine-ant-slaitinio-stogo.jpg" alt="Integrated Solutions – Usability of SoliTek Solar Panels">
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="container__wrapper--1-2">
                    <div class="image">
                                                                                    <img src="/storage/app/media/projects/2024/LTG-triuksmo-sienele-su-saules-moduliais-800x582.jpg" alt="Integrated Solutions – Usability of SoliTek Solar Panels">
                                                                        </div>
                    <div class="container__inner">
                        <div class="text-block text-block--dark reveal-text-block">
                            <p data-end="457" data-start="243">At SoliTek, we provide versatile and sustainable solar solutions designed to meet the needs of residential, commercial, and large-scale applications. Our glass-glass solar panels are used across multiple sectors:</p>

<ul data-end="1067" data-start="459">
	<li data-end="590" data-start="459">

		<p data-end="590" data-start="461"><strong data-end="498" data-start="461">Architectural integration (BIPV):</strong> Direct replacement of traditional roofing materials while preserving building aesthetics.</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="692" data-start="591">

		<p data-end="692" data-start="593"><strong data-end="633" data-start="593">Residential and commercial rooftops:</strong> Reliable energy generation with long-lasting durability.</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="781" data-start="693">

		<p data-end="781" data-start="695"><strong data-end="721" data-start="695">Carports and canopies:</strong> Combining solar energy with practical shading structures.</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="875" data-start="782">

		<p data-end="875" data-start="784"><strong data-end="815" data-start="784">Ground-mounted solar parks:</strong> Optimized for high energy yields and long-term stability.</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="987" data-start="876">

		<p data-end="987" data-start="878"><strong data-end="897" data-start="878">AgriPV systems:</strong> Supporting crop protection and agricultural productivity while generating green energy.</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="1067" data-start="988">

		<p data-end="1067" data-start="990"><strong data-end="1031" data-start="990">Sustainable architecture and facades:</strong> Blending design with performance.</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p data-end="1184" data-start="1069">In the upgraded production line (2026), we manufacture a wide range of advanced glass-glass solar panels.</p>

<p data-end="1367" data-start="1186">We have also developed highly effective solar parks in Lithuania and Ukraine. These technology-advanced solar parks use bifacial solar panels, solar trackers, and special white ground sheets, enabling up to 40% higher productivity compared to conventional parks.</p>
                        </div>
                                                <a href="https://www.solitek.eu/en/solar-panels" class="button button--primary button--arrow">Our Solar Panels</a>
                                            </div>
                </div>
            </div>
